    "description": "Group Assignment 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IOM201 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14435 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IOM201 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14435 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">5 weeks</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO 1-8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">The class should be divided into groups (4-5 students/group). Each group will be assigned a topic or a case study by the course instructor to conduct an in-depth analysis</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Word count (except References): 3500-4000 words</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">All chapters and learning materials covered in the course.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1: Take-Home<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1:<br>- Groups present their work on their assigned dates<br>- Groups must submit their reports in time.<br>- The report must include an Individual AI Reflection.<br>- Any proof of plagarism will result in grade 0 for the assignment for all members of the groups.<br>- Group assignment grade will be given based on the quality of the presentation and report with regard to the correctness and clarity of the explanation, as well as students' ability in addressing questions and concerns raised by their peers and the lecturer.<br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 19 — Individual Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Session 22 — Group Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Session 55 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Group Assignment Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 19 — Individual Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Buổi 22 — Group Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Buổi 55 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group Assignment Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
